        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Unit 13 - We're trying to save the earth!</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    max-width: 800px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 15px 25px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #333;\n    padding-bottom: 6px;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .header .left {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .dot-circle {\n    background: #7bbf3f;\n    color: white;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 20px;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n  }\n  .dots {\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    color: #444;\n    margin: 0 8px;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .section-num {\n    background: #7bbf3f;\n    color: white;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    min-width: 22px;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    margin-top: 1px;\n  }\n  .section-title p {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .phrase-box {\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    padding: 10px 15px;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n    row-gap: 6px;\n  }\n  .pink-box {\n    background: #f9dbe0;\n    border: 2px solid #d94f6e;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 12px 18px;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n  .pink-box ol {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n  }\n  .pink-box li {\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .fill {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #2b3a8f;\n    font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', cursive;\n    padding: 0 4px;\n  }\n  .underline-text {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n  .dotted-box {\n    border: 1px dotted #b8860b;\n    background: #fffef2;\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    margin: 10px 0 15px 0;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n    column-gap: 8px;\n    row-gap: 4px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .dotted-box .col-header {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  .handwritten-note {\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #2b3a8f;\n    font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', cursive;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin: 4px 0 4px 30px;\n    border-bottom: 1px dashed #2b3a8f;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .handwritten-note2 {\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #2b3a8f;\n    font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', cursive;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-left: 30px;\n  }\n  table.env-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  table.env-table th, table.env-table td {\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    padding: 8px;\n    text-align: left;\n    height: 30px;\n  }\n  table.env-table th {\n    background: #f2f2f2;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .page-footer {\n    text-align: right;\n    margin-top: 15px;\n  }\n  .page-num {\n    background: #7bbf3f;\n    color: white;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 26px;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  p.instructions {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"left\">\n      <span class=\"dot-circle\">●</span>\n      <span class=\"dots\">••••</span>\n      <span>We're trying to save the earth!</span>\n      <span class=\"dots\">••••••••</span>\n    </div>\n    <div>UNIT 13</div>\n    <div class=\"dots\">••••</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">\n    <span class=\"section-num\">2c</span>\n    <p>Fill in the blanks with the correct forms of the phrases in the box.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"phrase-box\">\n    <div>put to good use</div>\n    <div>build ... out of</div>\n    <div>pull down</div>\n    <div>set up</div>\n    <div>known for</div>\n    <div>not only ... but also</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pink-box\">\n    <ol>\n      <li>Amy Hayes lives in the UK. Many of the old buildings in her neighborhood were <span class=\"fill\">pulled down</span>.</li>\n      <li>All the rubbish and old things in Amy's neighborhood were then <span class=\"fill\">put to good use</span> when Amy built her house.</li>\n      <li>Amy is very creative. She <span class=\"fill\">built</span> her front gate <span class=\"fill\">out of</span> rocks and old glass bottles. She put an old boat on top of her house.</li>\n      <li>Jessica Wong sells her bags in a small shop, but she has also <span class=\"fill\">set up</span> an online business to sell them.</li>\n      <li>Though Jessica's bags are made from old clothes, her bags are <span class=\"fill\">known for</span> being cute and useful.</li>\n      <li><span class=\"fill\">not only</span> Wang Tao makes large pieces of metal art that look like animals or humans, <span class=\"fill\">but also</span> makes smaller pieces for the home.</li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">\n    <span class=\"section-num\">2d</span>\n    <p>Underline the words in the passage based on the words below. What are the differences?</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"dotted-box\">\n    <div class=\"col-header\">useful/</div>\n    <div class=\"col-header\">unusual</div>\n    <div class=\"col-header\">recycling</div>\n    <div class=\"col-header\">building</div>\n    <div class=\"col-header\">creation/creativity</div>\n\n    <div>rethink<br>think</div>\n    <div>unusual<br>usual</div>\n    <div>recycle</div>\n    <div>build</div>\n    <div>create<br>inspire</div>\n\n    <div>special<br>especially</div>\n    <div>recent<br>recently</div>\n    <div>environment<br>environmental</div>\n    <div>important<br>importance</div>\n    <div>inspiration</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">\n    <span class=\"section-num\">2e</span>\n    <p>Make a list of things that need to be done to save the environment. Which things can be done by common people every day? Which things have to be done by governments and organizations? Discuss these with your group.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n    <span class=\"handwritten-note\">need to do sth. 需要做某事</span>\n    <span class=\"handwritten-note2\">need to be done to be done (某事) 需要被做</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"handwritten-note2\">（惦记 v. +动词原形）</div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">\n    <span class=\"section-num\">3a</span>\n    <p>Think about the environment in your town/city and complete the chart below.<br>Which parts of the town/city have a nice environment? Why are they nice?<br>Which parts <span class=\"underline-text\">need</span> to be improved? Why?</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <table class=\"env-table\">\n    <tr>\n      <th>Good environment</th>\n      <th>Why?</th>\n      <th>Bad environment</th>\n      <th>Why?</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"page-footer\">\n    <span class=\"page-num\">103</span>\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
